  "description": "A mystery tale of young women gripped by the ghost of an encounter with a skeleton. \"Eunha Chae\" witnessed the shocking death of her friend a few years ago. \n\nAfter the \"skeleton incident\", she herself turned into a psychological menace to her classmates because of her nightmares. \n\nOne day, \"Soyeong Han\", a girl claiming to have experienced something similar four years ago returns to school. And now she's asking Eunha for her help in finding out the truth. \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
